# For the Netflix and Prime Video modules and YouTube's sign-in
# (scripts/web-player.sh): Chromium with Widevine, which their players need,
# cage, which gives the browser the screen when there is no desktop, and wtype,
# with which holding BACK closes the browser the way Ctrl+W does, keeping a
# fresh sign-in. Without recommends, like the rest, so the Pi's Chromium tweaks
# (rpi-chromium-mods), the GPU drivers and the fonts that Chromium only
# recommends are named here. os/build.sh skips all of it with MP240_STREAMING=0.
chromium rpi-chromium-mods libwidevinecdm0 libgl1-mesa-dri fonts-liberation
cage wtype
